// Test problem (200, 4, 1.6, 8) of Topaloglu (2009): 4 spokes out of a hub, 8 legs,
// 40 itineraries and 200 periods, with demand 1.6 times the seats and high fares 8
// times the low ones.
// Bounds on the optimal expected revenue: 29,413 (Lagrangian relaxation) and 30,570
// (deterministic LP). Revenue of bid prices recomputed at 5 points: 28,381 (Lagrangian
// relaxation) and 23,573 (deterministic LP).

non-fluents airline_revenue_nf1 {
	domain = airline_revenue;

	objects {
		airport : { hub, s1, s2, s3, s4 };
		leg : { s1-hub, s2-hub, s3-hub, s4-hub, hub-s1, hub-s2, hub-s3, hub-s4 };
